2026-09-24T04:28:26.2546983Z 
2026-09-24T04:28:26.2547201Z A blocked or observed runtime action is not proof that the final software works.
2026-09-24T04:28:26.2547871Z DiffWitness verifies the resulting Git change independently. Source code and raw prompts/diffs stay local by default.
2026-09-24T04:28:26.2548324Z 
